          { text = "😔 婉拒（自己也不宽裕）", result = "你解释了自己的困难。Kwame理解地点点头走了。你心里有点不是滋味。",
            effect = function() playerData_.karma = playerData_.karma - 1 end },
      },
      cond = function() return playerData_.day >= 4 end,
